  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a coach or consultant. Ask about the client's goals, the challenge they want to solve, timeline, and preferred format (1:1, group, online, in person). Ask about their business or context if relevant. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed after the discovery call. Do not promise specific business, financial, or personal outcomes.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much do you charge?",
      "a": "{price_note} Coaching is priced per session or per program. Tell us your goals, and we will recommend the right option.",
      "keywords": "cost,price,charge",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer a discovery call?",
      "a": "{discovery_note} Use it to talk through your goals before you commit to a program.",
      "keywords": "discovery,free call",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do online sessions?",
      "a": "Yes, via Zoom, Teams, or phone. Tell us which platform you prefer when you book.",
      "keywords": "online,zoom",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do in-person sessions?",
      "a": "Yes, in-person sessions are available in the local metro area. Let us know your suburb so we can confirm the location.",
      "keywords": "in person,face to face",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do group coaching?",
      "a": "Yes, group programs and masterminds are available. Group pricing is per person, so tell us how many people will join.",
      "keywords": "group,mastermind",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer corporate programs?",
      "a": "Yes, leadership and team programs are available for businesses. Corporate programs are charged per day, and we confirm the scope before you commit.",
      "keywords": "corporate,team",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "What's your approach?",
      "a": "We blend coaching, strategy, and accountability. Tell us what you want to achieve, and we will shape the work around it.",
      "keywords": "approach,method",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "How long is a session?",
      "a": "Sessions are usually 45–60 minutes. Intensives run for about half a day, so allow extra time.",
      "keywords": "how long,time",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "How many sessions do I need?",
      "a": "Most programs run 3–6 months. We will discuss the right length during the discovery call.",
      "keywords": "how many,sessions",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Are you certified?",
      "a": "{certification_note} Ask us for [your qualifications or accreditation] before you book.",
      "keywords": "certified,qualified",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer a guarantee?",
      "a": "{guarantee_note} Coaching outcomes depend on your own action, so we do not promise specific results.",
      "keywords": "guarantee",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer payment plans?",
      "a": "{payment_note} Ask us what options are available before you sign up.",
      "keywords": "payment plan,instalment",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your cancellation policy?",
      "a": "Cancelling with less than {cancellation_notice} may incur a fee. Tell us early if you need to move a session.",
      "keywords": "cancel",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you run workshops?",
      "a": "Yes, workshops and retreats are available. Workshops are charged per half day, and retreats are charged per person.",
      "keywords": "workshop,retreat",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you sign NDAs?",
      "a": "Yes, we sign a non-disclosure agreement on request before we discuss confidential business details.",
      "keywords": "nda,confidential",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I switch coaches?",
      "a": "Yes, we will rematch you if it is not the right fit. Let us know what is not working so we can find a better match.",
      "keywords": "switch,match",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "What do I need to prepare before we start?",
      "a": "Tell us your goals, the challenge you want to solve, your timeline, and your preferred format: 1:1, group, online, or in person.",
      "keywords": "prepare,brief,goals",
      "priority": 8
    }
  ],
